<p id="A5.SS5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A5.T6" title="Table 6 ‣ E.5 Hyperparameters ‣ Appendix E Experimental Details ‣ Preference Robustness for DPO with Applications to Public Health" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> shows the hyperparameters used during training.</p>
</div>
