<section id="A6.SS2.SSSx2" class="ltx_subsubsection">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsubsection">UltraFeedback results on Llama3 8B</h4>

<div id="A6.SS2.SSSx2.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.SS2.SSSx2.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Table <a href="#A6.T9.st2" title="In Table 9 ‣ UltraFeedback results on Llama3 8B ‣ F.2 Additional Ablations ‣ Appendix F Additional Results and Ablations ‣ Preference Robustness for DPO with Applications to Public Health" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9(b)</span></a> shows the results of fitting the LLama 3 8B model instead of the Phi3-mini 3B model. As expected the results are slightly higher considering the larger and more capable initial neural network. However, the memory and computation requirements also increase.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A6.T9" class="ltx_table">

<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 9: </span>Results on UltraFeedback under label-flip noise run with Llama3 8B. Mean and standard error over 2000 evaluation samples are shown.</figcaption><div class="ltx_flex_figure">
