<section id="A7" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix G </span>Prompts</h2>

<figure id="A7.F6" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A7.F6.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="272.73" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 700 272.73" width="700"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,272.73) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 0 232.62)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:9.54em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="131.95"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">table]box:rwgenerator</span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.29 L 0 251.32 C 0 255.89 3.71 259.6 8.29 259.6 L 691.71 259.6 C 696.29 259.6 700 255.89 700 251.32 L 700 8.29 C 700 3.71 696.29 0 691.71 0 L 8.29 0 C 3.71 0 0 3.71 0 8.29 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F8F8F8;" fill="#F8F8F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.42 8.29 L 0.42 251.32 C 0.42 255.66 3.94 259.19 8.29 259.19 L 691.71 259.19 C 696.06 259.19 699.58 255.66 699.58 251.32 L 699.58 8.29 C 699.58 3.94 696.06 0.42 691.71 0.42 L 8.29 0.42 C 3.94 0.42 0.42 3.94 0.42 8.29 Z"></path></g><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15.75 249.76)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_nestedsvg" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.29 L 0 14.68 C 0 19.26 3.71 22.97 8.29 22.97 L 306.91 22.97 C 311.49 22.97 315.2 19.26 315.2 14.68 L 315.2 8.29 C 315.2 3.71 311.49 0 306.91 0 L 8.29 0 C 3.71 0 0 3.71 0 8.29 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F8F8F8;" fill="#F8F8F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.42 8.29 L 0.42 14.68 C 0.42 19.03 3.94 22.56 8.29 22.56 L 306.91 22.56 C 311.26 22.56 314.79 19.03 314.79 14.68 L 314.79 8.29 C 314.79 3.94 311.26 0.42 306.91 0.42 L 8.29 0.42 C 3.94 0.42 0.42 3.94 0.42 8.29 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.23 8.03)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:18.3em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="291.19"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A7.F6.pic1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">LLM prompt to generate reward function</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.1 14.99)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:47.68em;--ltx-fo-height:16.79em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="235.15" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 232.39)" width="659.76"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A7.F6.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:47.68em;">
<span id="A7.F6.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F6.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Prompt<span id="A7.F6.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">Create a Python reward function for RL in phone call resource allocation to mothers in India,
with the objective of prioritizing higher states and: {goal_prompt}.

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">The function should use ’state’ (value is either 0 or 1) and features ’agent_feats’
to direct the RL agent.

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Here is a description of the features you may use along with the index in the ’agent_feats’ array:
{PROMPT_FEAT_DESC_DICT}

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Your task:

<br class="ltx_break">1. Write a simple, single-line Python reward function.
- Exclude the word ’return’.
- Exclude non-standard libraries.
- Format your code with []:
[YOUR FUNCTION].

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">2. Note that HIGHER states are always preferred, so ensure the reward increases as ’state’ increases.

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">3. Make sure the reward is always positive and increasing with state.

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">4. Avoid using bitwise operators. Use ’and’, ’or’ instead.

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Here is an example to guide you:
<span id="A7.F6.pic1.2.1.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">PROMPT_REW_EXAMPLE_DICT</span>

<br class="ltx_break">
<br class="ltx_break">Come up with a unique new reward for the specified goal: <span id="A7.F6.pic1.2.1.1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_markedasmath">goal_prompt</span>.</span></span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 6: </span>Prompt passed to the LLM to generate a reward function based on the context of problem scenario in Real World Domain.</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A7.F7" class="ltx_figure"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="A7.F7.pic1" class="ltx_picture ltx_centering" height="967.35" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 700 967.35" width="700"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,967.35) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 0 927.24)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:9.54em;--ltx-fo-height:0.75em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.25em;font-size:10pt;" height="13.84" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 10.38)" width="131.95"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">table]box:rwgenerator</span></span></foreignObject></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.29 L 0 945.93 C 0 950.51 3.71 954.22 8.29 954.22 L 691.71 954.22 C 696.29 954.22 700 950.51 700 945.93 L 700 8.29 C 700 3.71 696.29 0 691.71 0 L 8.29 0 C 3.71 0 0 3.71 0 8.29 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F8F8F8;" fill="#F8F8F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.42 8.29 L 0.42 945.93 C 0.42 950.28 3.94 953.81 8.29 953.81 L 691.71 953.81 C 696.06 953.81 699.58 950.28 699.58 945.93 L 699.58 8.29 C 699.58 3.94 696.06 0.42 691.71 0.42 L 8.29 0.42 C 3.94 0.42 0.42 3.94 0.42 8.29 Z"></path></g><g transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 15.75 944.38)"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" class="ltx_nestedsvg" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="matrix(1 0 0 1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 8.29 L 0 14.68 C 0 19.26 3.71 22.97 8.29 22.97 L 310.62 22.97 C 315.2 22.97 318.91 19.26 318.91 14.68 L 318.91 8.29 C 318.91 3.71 315.2 0 310.62 0 L 8.29 0 C 3.71 0 0 3.71 0 8.29 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F8F8F8;" fill="#F8F8F8" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.42 8.29 L 0.42 14.68 C 0.42 19.03 3.94 22.56 8.29 22.56 L 310.62 22.56 C 314.97 22.56 318.5 19.03 318.5 14.68 L 318.5 8.29 C 318.5 3.94 314.97 0.42 310.62 0.42 L 8.29 0.42 C 3.94 0.42 0.42 3.94 0.42 8.29 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 12.23 8.03)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:18.48em;--ltx-fo-height:0.6em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.17em;font-size:11.5pt;" height="12.3" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 9.61)" width="294.02"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content"><span id="A7.F7.pic1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">LLM Judge to Decide Preferred Response</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 20.1 12.23)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:47.68em;--ltx-fo-height:67.2em;--ltx-fo-depth:0em;font-size:10pt;" height="929.78" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 929.78)" width="659.76"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
<span id="A7.F7.pic1.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_minipage ltx_align_bottom" style="width:47.68em;">
<span id="A7.F7.pic1.2.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F7.pic1.2.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif ltx_font_bold" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Prompt<span id="A7.F7.pic1.2.1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> 
<br class="ltx_break">My goal was to create a Python reward function for RL in resource allocation, with the objective of: Focus on those with high education. I tried several reward
functions for this task. Below, I have the given reward function, and the corresponding distribution of reward achieved.</span></span></span>
<span id="A7.F7.pic1.2.2" class="ltx_p"><span id="A7.F7.pic1.2.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_sansserif" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Below are the reward functions I used and their corresponding reward distributions:</span></span>
